#: ../../tools/klifs_tools.rst:63 9e8d987e05cc40b1b4824faf2a4b7c57
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get all ligands (co-crystallized inhibitors) bound to a "
"specific kinase across all its crystal structures in KLIFS. Returns "
"ligand PDB 3-letter codes, names, SMILES structures, and InChIKeys. "
"Useful for identifying known inhibitors and their chemical scaffolds for "
"a given kinase target. Use KLIFS\\_list\\_kinases to find kinase IDs."
msgstr ""

